EXPORTS
    PassThruOpen
    PassThruClose
    PassThruConnect
    PassThruDisconnect
    PassThruReadMsgs
    PassThruWriteMsgs
    PassThruStartPeriodicMsg
    PassThruStopPeriodicMsg
    PassThruStartMsgFilter
    PassThruStopMsgFilter
    PassThruSetProgrammingVoltage
    PassThruReadVersion
    PassThruGetLastError
    PassThruIoctl
    DllRegisterServer PRIVATE
    DllUnregisterServer PRIVATE
